         coach_notes = CASE WHEN coach_notes = '2027 Canada Powerlifting National Championships, Nanaimo, BC. Window Feb 8–13 2027, lifting day TBD: Feb 8 is the conservative anchor; when the day is confirmed run public.pl_prep_set_meet_day(prep, day) (preview first, then with _apply => true) to move the Week 11–12 sessions with it. Weeks 1–10 stay.

