- Week 12 Tuesday is an optional session, and every Week 11–12 day is locked to its meet-relative date so an automatic re-plan can never slide the taper.' THEN '2027 Canada Powerlifting National Championships, Nanaimo BC. Window Feb 8–13 2027, lifting day TBD: Feb 8 is the conservative anchor. When the day is confirmed, Confirm lifting day on Jared''s Training tab shows each lift''s final heavy day planned from his past meets and this prep''s response (or the even shift) and moves the Week 11–12 sessions. Weeks 1–10 stay.

